={{
  "A DataSync error has occurred with " + $json.DistrictName + " (" + $json.districtID + ")." +
  ($json.sistype ? " This district uses the " + $json.sistype + " SIS" : "") +
  " and was last synced " + $json.Duration + " day(s) ago on " + new Date($json.LastSync).toLocaleDateString("en-US", { month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) + " @ " + new Date($json.LastSync).toLocaleTimeString("en-US", { hour: 'numeric', minute: 'numeric', hour12: true }).toLowerCase() + "." +
  (
    $('Extract Data from Email').item.json.message.content.Errors && $('Extract Data from Email').item.json.message.content.Errors.length > 0
    ? " The following errors were encountered: " + $('Extract Data from Email').item.json.message.content.Errors.map(e => "[" + e.ErrorMessage + " (Count: " + e.ErrorCount + ")]").join(", ")
    : ""
  ) +
  (
    $('Extract Data from Email').item.json.message.content.MultipleEmailsPerUser && $('Extract Data from Email').item.json.message.content.MultipleEmailsPerUser.length > 0
    ? " [Identifiers were found with multiple email addresses]."
    : ""
  ) +
  (
    $json.techcontact 
    ? " Please contact " + $json.techcontact + " (" + $json.techemail + ") at " + $json.techphone + "."
    : ""
  )
}}

values.content:
You are an AI agent that processes automated emails from a Windows Scheduler alerting system and extracts relevant information. The email format is consistent and contains the following sections:

"Login" field: This appears right after the keyword "Login:" and before the word "Error".
"Error" field: A string or an array of values. Write a summary for the errors encountered. Include counts if the error contains multiple values.
Ignore the rest of the email, including any confidentiality notices.
Your task is to extract the following:

The login identifier (appears after "Login:").
The error messages (appears after "Error:").
Return the extracted data in JSON format, with the following structure:

{
  "Login": {"Login": "login_value"},
  "Errors": [
    {"ErrorMessage": "error_message", "ErrorCount": error_count_value},
    {"Email": "email_value", "ID": "id_value"}
  ],
  "MultipleEmailsPerUser": [
    {"ID": "user_id_value", "Email": "email_value"},
    {"ID": "user_id_value", "Email": "email_value"}
  ]
}


Example: Email:
Login: sachemadmin - Error: Failed to update EVI - The following email addresses had multiple unique IDs - they have been excluded: rchirichella@sachem.edu: 1686705 & 9999999 The following user identifiers had multiple email addresses - they have been excluded: 1026779: i_lcroce@sachem.edu & lcroce@sachem.edu

Response:

{
  "Login": {"Login": "sachemadmin"},
  "Errors": [
    {"ErrorMessage": "The following email addresses had multiple unique IDs", "ErrorCount": 2},
    {"ErrorMessage": "The following user identifiers had multiple email addresses", "ErrorCount": 2}
  ],
  "MultipleEmailsPerUser": [
    {"ID": "1026779", "Email": "i_lcroce@sachem.edu"},
    {"ID": "1026779", "Email": "lcroce@sachem.edu"}
  ]
}
